{"municipality_code":"22344","pref":"静岡県","city":"小山町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"小山町には、小山村、生土村、中島村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「足柄城跡」、「竹之下古戦場跡」、「横山遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、小山村や生土村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 田・新田・用水にちなむ地名が多い場所では、土地改良碑や用水記念碑も注目したい探索対象です。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 「富士スピードウェイ」や「セルモ第一工場」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":185,"rank":427,"percentile":77.5,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":12,"rank":855,"percentile":53.3,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":25,"rank":1017,"percentile":45.0,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":11,"rank":752,"percentile":56.7,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":4,"rank":882,"percentile":46.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":4,"rank":933,"percentile":43.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":25,"rank":690,"percentile":62.6,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_peo